# Cursor Rules for Agent Skills

## Repository Purpose
This repository hosts reusable skills following the Agent Skills specification (`agentskills.io`).

## Skills Structure
- Every skill is located in `skills/<skill-name>/`.
- The entrypoint for an agent is `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
- Read the YAML frontmatter of `SKILL.md` to determine suitability.

## Active Skills
- `review-walkthrough`: When the user asks for a code review, branch walkthrough, or a reading plan for git changes, read `skills/review-walkthrough/SKILL.md` and follow its plan-generation + standby co-pilot procedure.
- `mr-comment-triage`: When the user asks to handle review comments, triage PR/MR feedback, or respond to reviewers, read `skills/mr-comment-triage/SKILL.md` and follow its fetch → verify → approve → apply → reply procedure. Never post replies without an explicit go-ahead.
